# What the image build does not need to be sent.
#
# The build context is `Firmware/` and the image copies exactly one file out of it
# (`Training/requirements.txt`), so everything else here is bytes handed to the daemon for nothing.
# Without this the context carries three build trees, a virtual environment and a few hundred
# megabytes of NEAT checkpoints — which is slow enough to look like a hung build.
build/
build-host/
build-test/
Training/.venv/
Training/campaign/
Training/checkpoint-neat-*
Training/train.log
__pycache__/
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
